# Tabs

Tabs switch between related views on the same page. Bind `value` to control the active tab; otherwise the first enabled tab opens.

Use `size="sm"` for smaller tabs, `variant="line"` for navigation, and `width="full"` to share the available width. Give the tab list a concise `label` for screen readers.

Use `variant="badge"` for separate, fully rounded tabs on a transparent list. Badge tabs support both sizes, `width="full"`, and `orientation="vertical"`. The `border` prop only affects the default and line variants.

